				Time="2011-11-08T09:34:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｆー００『タノシイ！　タノシイ！
[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]！　ポケモン　タノシイ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
